WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.133 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:01.133 --> 00:00:02.550 align:middle line:84%
When I'm working
through my inbox,

3
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.883 align:middle line:84%
sometimes I think of something
that the rest of the team

4
00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:06.630 align:middle line:90%
needs to know about our project.

5
00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.395 align:middle line:84%
Rather than logging
into Basecamp,

6
00:00:08.395 --> 00:00:10.020 align:middle line:84%
I can send a quick
email to the project

7
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.210 align:middle line:84%
and everyone will
be notified of it.

8
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.820 align:middle line:84%
You can see here that each
project has a unique email

9
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.840 align:middle line:90%
address.

10
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.450 align:middle line:84%
I've saved that to my
address book for easy use.

11
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.060 align:middle line:84%
Let's create a new email and
then use that unique project

12
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.570 align:middle line:90%
address.

13
00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.300 align:middle line:84%
I'll type out the idea
ahead and then send it just

14
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.280 align:middle line:90%
like a normal email.

15
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.260 align:middle line:84%
When I log into
Basecamp later, I

16
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.335 align:middle line:84%
can see that message
posted from my email

17
00:00:31.335 --> 00:00:32.710 align:middle line:84%
and that everyone
else on my team

18
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.220 align:middle line:90%
can see that brilliant idea.
